  "description": "NvAPIWrapper is a comprehensive .NET wrapper for the NVIDIA public API, featuring full support for RTX 40 (Ada) and RTX 50 (Blackwell) series. Now includes real-time power telemetry in Watts, automatic TDP detection, and modern C# features.",
