  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 9.0.2\n\n  - Kept all projects on net6.0 for compatibility and stable distribution.\n  - Resolved critical nullable-contract warning families across wrapper APIs (CS8765/CS8767/CS8625/CS86xx hotspots).\n  - Hardened equality/operator null handling in key Display/GPU/Mosaic/Stereo model types.\n  - Improved telemetry and fallback behavior in GPU power/thermal/usage flows.\n  - Expanded and stabilized GPU power spec matching logic and thread-safety.\n  - Added shared NVAPI capability-unavailable status helper for safer fallback paths.\n  - Release build validated successfully.",
